        }
      ],
      "message": "net: use exclusive P2P listen sockets on Windows\n\nOn Windows, `SO_REUSEADDR` does not give sockets exclusive use of an\naddress and port, so another process running under the same user\naccount can bind to the same port and intercept incoming P2P\nconnections.\n\nMake the P2P listen port exclusive on Windows by using\n`SO_EXCLUSIVEADDRUSE` so as to prevent this.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "winterrdog",
        "email": "winterrdog@protonmail.ch",
        "date": "2026-09-19T12:34:23Z"
      },
